  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "8DA4593E928F4587",
      "text": "欢迎来到锦汇道馆！\\n需要再听一次\\r\\n道馆测验的说明吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "8DA45A3E928F473A",
      "text": "锦汇道馆的\\n道馆测验是……\\r\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]点秘密菜单的菜[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "8DA45B3E928F48ED",
      "text": "过关条件是在锦汇镇中\\n很受欢迎的[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]宝食堂[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\r\\n点秘密菜单的菜。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "8DA4543E928F3D08",
      "text": "现在这个镇子里\\n除你之外还有３位\\r\\n道馆测验的挑战者。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_05",
      "hash64": "8DA4553E928F3EBB",
      "text": "每位挑战者都知道一部分\\n秘密菜单的提示，但内容都不一样。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_06",
      "hash64": "8DA4563E928F406E",
      "text": "请你们几位挑战者互相对战，\\n输的一方要把自己知道的提示\\r\\n告诉赢的一方。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_07",
      "hash64": "8DA4573E928F4221",
      "text": "然后根据收集到的提示，\\n找宝食堂的店员\\r\\n点秘密菜单的菜吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_08",
      "hash64": "8DA4503E928F363C",
      "text": "能成功点菜的挑战者就能\\n通过道馆测验，仅限一人。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_09",
      "hash64": "8DA4513E928F37EF",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n你的提示是[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]常客的吃法[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_10",
      "hash64": "8DA7DE3E92925D5D",
      "text": "去向宝食堂的常客\\n打听一下或许是个好主意哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_normal_01",
      "hash64": "AE31BE5429DB5DDF",
      "text": "嚼啊嚼……\\n咽啊咽……[VAR 0x0114(0038)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0038"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_select_01",
      "hash64": "B588972BCEF95112",
      "text": "你是常客……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_select_02",
      "hash64": "B588962BCEF94F5F",
      "text": "这是秘密菜单？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_normal_02a",
      "hash64": "D9E80F031FC409E9",
      "text": "没错……\\n我经常来这家店。[VAR 0x0114(0038)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0038"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_normal_03a",
      "hash64": "D9EAF3031FC6102C",
      "text": "……你是道馆测验的挑战者吗？[VAR 0x0114(0038)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0038"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_normal_02b",
      "hash64": "D9E80C031FC404D0",
      "text": "我现在吃的是\\n一般菜单的菜。不过……[VAR 0x0114(0038)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0038"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_normal_04",
      "hash64": "AE31B95429DB5560",
      "text": "挤一挤[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]柠檬[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]，\\n就会又爽口，又好吃。[VAR 0x0114(0038)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0038"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_normal_05",
      "hash64": "AE31BA5429DB5713",
      "text": "挤一挤[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]柠檬[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]，\\n就会又爽口又好吃。\\c\\n……这可能要\\n长大了才能明白。[VAR 0x0114(0038)]",
